# AI / LLM instructions
# CLAUDE.md is deliberately NOT ignored. It is the working contract every
# agent reads first, so it has to be versioned with the code it describes.
# While it was ignored, three separate agents made correct corrections to it
# (the 7.50 ceiling, price-by-mode, the attempt-logging contract) that could
# not be committed and had to be hand-carried to the owner as a loose file.
# Un-ignored on the owner's instruction, 2026-08-27.

# Planning documents are NOT ignored. The product plan and the five stage
# documents used to live in an ignored project_plan/ directory, so a clone of
# this repo contained none of them even though CLAUDE.md section 1 tells every
# reader to read the stage document first and section 3 lists them under
# docs/. They hold environment variable names only, never values, and no
# personal data, so there is nothing in them to withhold. Moved to the paths
# CLAUDE.md already named and tracked from 2026-08-28.
logs/
